MODULE: RoutingSnapshotFreshRetainsOldEpoch
TARGET: RoutingSnapshotFresh
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: routing refresh retains the stale captured epoch
PERTURBS: SagaReRoute
BOUNDS: AllowReroute = TRUE

--- FIND
    /\ saga' = [saga EXCEPT !.capturedEpoch = epoch',
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: keep the old epoch after the routing change.
    /\ saga' = [saga EXCEPT !.capturedEpoch = epoch,
--- END
